 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "This skateboard",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 0.87,
   "show": 0.0,
   "hide": 0.89
  },
  {
   "text": "could make you FLY",
   "emph": [
    "fly"
   ],
   "start": 0.93,
   "end": 1.87,
   "show": 0.89,
   "hide": 1.89
  },
  {
   "text": "across a RIVER.",
   "emph": [
    "river"
   ],
   "start": 1.93,
   "end": 2.81,
   "show": 1.89,
   "hide": 2.998
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, ten powerful",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 3.038,
   "end": 4.436,
   "show": 2.998,
   "hide": 4.436
  },
  {
   "text": "electric propellers",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 4.476,
   "end": 5.296,
   "show": 4.436,
   "hide": 5.416
  },
  {
   "text": "blast air downward,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 5.456,
   "end": 6.556,
   "show": 5.416,
   "hide": 6.716
  },
  {
   "text": "lifting you completely",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 6.756,
   "end": 7.796,
   "show": 6.716,
   "hide": 7.816
  },
  {
   "text": "off the ground.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 7.856,
   "end": 8.456,
   "show": 7.816,
   "hide": 8.614
  },
  {
   "text": "But his first version",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 8.654,
   "end": 9.664,
   "show": 8.614,
   "hide": 9.704
  },
  {
   "text": "used JET ENGINES\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "jet",
    "engines"
   ],
   "start": 9.744,
   "end": 10.804,
   "show": 9.704,
   "hide": 10.972
  },
  {
   "text": "and caught FIRE.",
   "emph": [
    "fire"
   ],
   "start": 11.012,
   "end": 12.032,
   "show": 10.972,
   "hide": 12.162
  },
  {
   "text": "So he switched to electric.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 12.26,
   "end": 13.6,
   "show": 12.22,
   "hide": 13.758
  },
  {
   "text": "Except there\u2019s",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 13.798,
   "end": 14.458,
   "show": 13.758,
   "hide": 14.478
  },
  {
   "text": "one HUGE problem.",
   "emph": [
    "huge"
   ],
   "start": 14.518,
   "end": 15.938,
   "show": 14.478,
   "hide": 16.096
  },
  {
   "text": "The board can\u2019t",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 16.136,
   "end": 16.916,
   "show": 16.096,
   "hide": 16.916
  },
  {
   "text": "balance itself.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 16.956,
   "end": 17.796,
   "show": 16.916,
   "hide": 17.954
  },
  {
   "text": "He has to control it",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 17.994,
   "end": 18.864,
   "show": 17.954,
   "hide": 18.864
  },
  {
   "text": "with his entire BODY,",
   "emph": [
    "body"
   ],
   "start": 18.904,
   "end": 20.044,
   "show": 18.864,
   "hide": 20.224
  },
  {
   "text": "while an AI voice coach",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 20.264,
   "end": 21.444,
   "show": 20.224,
   "hide": 21.444
  },
  {
   "text": "helps him learn",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 21.484,
   "end": 22.004,
   "show": 21.444,
   "hide": 22.004
  },
  {
   "text": "how to balance.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 22.044,
   "end": 22.664,
   "show": 22.004,
   "hide": 22.822
  },
  {
   "text": "And after just over",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 22.862,
   "end": 23.802,
   "show": 22.822,
   "hide": 23.802
  },
  {
   "text": "ten days of practice,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 23.842,
   "end": 24.942,
   "show": 23.802,
   "hide": 25.132
  },
  {
   "text": "he actually flew",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 25.172,
   "end": 26.062,
   "show": 25.132,
   "hide": 26.062
  },
  {
   "text": "across a RIVER\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "river"
   ],
   "start": 26.102,
   "end": 26.962,
   "show": 26.062,
   "hide": 27.13
  },
  {
   "text": "and THROUGH a CANYON.",
   "emph": [
    "through",
    "canyon"
   ],
   "start": 27.17,
   "end": 28.37,
   "show": 27.13,
   "hide": 28.526
  },
  {
   "text": "How much would someone",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 28.628,
   "end": 29.318,
   "show": 28.588,
   "hide": 29.338
  },
  {
   "text": "have to PAY YOU",
   "emph": [
    "pay",
    "you"
   ],
   "start": 29.378,
   "end": 30.178,
   "show": 29.338,
   "hide": 30.178
  },
  {
   "text": "to ride this thing?",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 30.218,
   "end": 30.998,
   "show": 30.178,
   "hide": 31.3
  }
 ],
